:
:
: Ave! Another Day. Another tool 8) Hehe the times are long over,
: or, we have never reached the level to do this.
:
: This time we have to say: Another tool each century!!!
:
: Don` t know if there is a need of such kind of Door.
: Sick Boy decided, a few months ago, that the Conferences in her BBS
: are running out of Control.
:
: We start searching for any fucking tool, who do a job like the fucking
: CNet does with the Sub-Directories in each Conference.
:
: We started coding (in lousy Arexx, cause i`m to stupid to make my C/ASM
: doors running in fame) a tool for us, the first step was a 4 kb door. But now
: we reached a size about 30 kb, too much work to take it for our own use.
:
: Also here it is: RLG-DirMover. So pray to us (Am besten in D-Mark 8)
:
: Spenden bitte an       Brot fuer die Welt  -> CityofSilence@gmx.net
:          oder an    Die Wurst bleibt hier  -> CityofMystery@gmx.de
:
:
: A short fairy tale about RELIGION and why we are back on stage in this
: century! Yeah.. we survived the armageddon in 1999 and 1992/94/96 a.s.o.
:
: Religion was founded in the end of 1992 by me... Hawkwind & N.O.S.
: (N.O.S,ABKDJD,ANKH don`t remember the names yet ;)
:
: Our last release was in 1995 or so what, who cares?
:
: Now we need a name for our tool and forthcoming releases... in the first
: days i met Sick Boy. I told them about Religion and other greatfull days
: in the AMIGA Scene (HARHAR give me a little TIMEWARPER, plEEEASE).
:
: Okay! We decided to release them under Religion. Also hope that you hear
: something more from us. This is our last revival...
:
: Okay! Okay! Don`t shoot us down... let`s go to "What is this fucking tool"
:
