                             :..:                                        :                                                                        ;
                                                                         :
                   - What the hell is "RLG-DirMover V1.0" -              :
                                                                         :
.......................................................................  :
:                                                                     :..:
:
:
: With this Door you can create 9 Sub-Directories in each Conference.
:
: Means:  AMIGA WAREZ     (Standart Conference)
:
:                         AMIGA OLDYS     (First Sub-Directory)
:                         AMIGA DEMOS     (Second)
:                         NEEDFULL THINGS (And so on)
:
: The User or YOU can Upload with our RLG-DirMover in each Sub-Conference
: and view them via "FR" or "N".
: The RLG-DirLister is there to show the User which Sub-Conferences are available.
: The RLG-DirEd is there to make the usage for YOU much easier.
:
: View the Manualpart for each TOOL!!! "How does it work" It`s better for
: your Bulletin Board System. Make sure that you understand it or there can
: be much trouble with your filelistings.
:
:                                           ...
:...........................................:.:
                                            :.............................
                                                                         :
