                                                                 :
.................................................................:
:
:
: This programm is Puplic Domain, spread it to everybody you want!
:
: We don`t take care or anything else to any hardware or software error, that
: occured to your system during using our warez.
:
: This is our first door for the puplic. We don`t take care of any rulez for
: coding this door (is there a need for in AREXX?).
: We did everything to make it easy to use.
: And if there is an error you will be notified about it. (So Hope)
:
