                                                                        :
                                                                        :
                             - Installation -                           :
                                                                        :
........................................................................:
:
:
: First:   Rename the original BBSCMD "U" to "U-RLG"
:
: Copy the whole Archive to your FAME Partition.
:
: That`s all.
:
: Start the Command "CED" and enter a value of Sub-Directories.
: Start it again and change what you want.
:
: Try to Upload something in the new Directories. Command "U".
:
: Don`t forget to build in the RLG-DirLister "L"
: we prefer in CONFERENCES/????/Bull.txt   " ~CC-L "
:
: And don`t forget to read "How does it works"
:
:
: If you have problems with using this door, or if anything is not clear.
: (After some tries).
:
: Please delete it from your System and wait for a later release.
:
:
:........................................................................
                                                                        :
                                                                        :
   ....                   - How does it work -                          :
...:..:                                                                 :
:  :....................................................................:
:
:
: RLG-DirLister:
:
: It shows the Sub-Directorys by using the Fame:Conferences/???/RLG-DirConfig
: in each Conference.
:
: Nothing more. Use the Command "L"
:
:
:
:
:
: RLG-DirMover:
:
: It shows the Sub-Directorys by using the Fame:Conferences/???/RLG-DirConfig
: in each Conference.
:
: Ask the User in which Sub-Conference he wants to Upload some files.
:
: Use the Command "U"
:
:
: What does the Door do with your Directories and Filelistings:
:
: It renames the actual (last) Directory Filelisting to DIR0
: then it renames the selected Filelisting to (last) actual Dir(X)
:
: After the Upload is finished - the same way backwards.
:
: If there occures some Trouble.
:
: The Door will never start again in this Conference, until the error
: is fixed.
:
: A File, named "TEMP_CONFERENCENAME" will be created in RAM:RLG-DirMover.
:
: You will be notified if something like this has happened via SHELL.
:
: There also will be created a file in DOORS:RELIGION/RLG-DirMover/DATA/CRASH
: But this is only necessary if an error occures during the Upload.
:
: You have to delete all files by hand and solve the problem.
: That`s the reason why you must understand the way the door works.
:
:
:
:
:
: RLG-DirEd:
:
: This is coded for a better overview. It should work fine. (We hope so)
: Follow the Instructions 8).
:
:                   ....
:                   :  :
:...................:..:
                    :........................... .  . ...................
                                                                        :
                              - IMPORTANT -                             :
                                                                        :
........................................................................:
:
: -Don`t use the Door if YOU have installed FAME the first time.
:  You must know what Fame does with the Filelistings, elsewhere it
:  could be that you don`t find the error when something runs out of control.
:
: -Test the door in a Conference which is not important, or create a new one.
:
:
:
: -Make sure that your Conferences in Fame System Editor are namend this way:
:
:  AMIGA_WAREZ   not   AMIGA WAREZ  or the Door won`t work  (NO SPACES)
.
.
.
: -Make sure that you have renamed the org. command "U" to "U-RLG"
:
: -The Door will only work with ONE USER in each Directory.
:  If another User wants to Upload in the same Conference at the same time
:  he will be notified that another User Uploads right now.
:  SORRY! But there isn`t any other way yet.
:
: -Increase or Decrease the amount of Directories in FAME System Editor for
:  each Conference by hand. Every time.
:
: -Don`t edit the RLG-DirConfig File, without using the RLG-DirEd.
:  Or make sure that you change it in the same way, elsewhere it won`t work.
:
: -Timeouts will make the door crash. (Coz. the Tempfiles will be not deleted)
:
: -Don`t change any paths or anything of the codeworks.
:
: -Don`t delete DIR1 in the Conferences.
:
: -Make sure that a File called "DIR1" exists in each conference.
:
: -New files must be uploaded in the last Sub-Directory, elsewhere the files
:  will not be shown with "NEWFILESCAN" on login.
:
: -The Door is still under Construction. Maybe we recode it in C if there is
:  a need for.
:
: -As you can see there are much problems. If you have some Ideas or if
:  you want to code something like this, to make it work much more effective,
:  don`t waste your time. Have Phun and good luck.
:
:
